@format 1
@id export.delete-preset
@title Delete export preset
@area Export
@entry input
@summary Remove one selected custom export preset while protecting native presets, then select the first surviving preset.
@flow TB
@related export.add-preset

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Delete requested <input>
- Receive the selected preset's Delete command @ export.PExportPresetDelete(...)
> eligible

[eligible] Check preset kind <decision>
- Reject deletion of native presets @ export.PExportPresetDelete(...)
? "No preset is selected or the preset is native" > unchanged
? "Selected custom preset can be deleted" > remove

[remove] Remove preset <process>
- Delete the custom preset, load the first surviving preset when possible, and refresh the summary @ export.PExportPresetDelete(...)
> result

[result] Preset deleted <output>
= The custom preset is no longer available.

[unchanged] Preset retained <output>
= Preset collection is unchanged.
